{"4304890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mad Scientist Simulator – Society of World Destruction", "steam_appid": 4304890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BEING THE BAD GUY HAS NEVER BEEN THIS FUN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of being the hero, playing by the rules, and saving the world? Put on your lab coat in <strong>Mad Scientist Simulator: Society of World Destruction</strong> and climb the ranks from a lowly <i>Lab Rat</i> to the ultimate <i>Syndicate Leader</i> to become the most favored member of the &quot;Society of World Destruction&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you are not just a lunatic shooting around; you are an evil genius working meticulously in your lab. Your goal: Complete missions from the Society, invent new technologies, and unleash ultimate chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/ae6048ec22f9a5d13957852450261f8b.poster.avif?t=1772696013\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/ae6048ec22f9a5d13957852450261f8b.webm?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/ae6048ec22f9a5d13957852450261f8b.mp4?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 <strong>Your Lab &amp; Workshop, Your Fortress:</strong> Chaos hits the streets, but it's brewed in the lab. Create deadly viruses, acid mixtures, and DNA modifications through 2D and 3D mini-games at your chemistry and biology tables. Not enough? <strong>Head over to the Lathe Machine to assemble your own custom weapons piece by piece and boost your firepower!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/1bdb946f81dc7390b53e72bfe4f8826a.poster.avif?t=1772696013\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/1bdb946f81dc7390b53e72bfe4f8826a.webm?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/1bdb946f81dc7390b53e72bfe4f8826a.mp4?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ <strong>Global Domination (War Room):</strong> Spread your evil not just to the neighborhood, but to the entire world! Enter the War Room in your lab, select target countries on the interactive world map, and strategically deploy the drones and robots you've crafted to bring cities under the Society's control one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/f3a98ffa3cd13cd35a7b6a7a7d119609.poster.avif?t=1772696013\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/f3a98ffa3cd13cd35a7b6a7a7d119609.webm?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/f3a98ffa3cd13cd35a7b6a7a7d119609.mp4?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗 <strong>Wreak Havoc in the City:</strong> The streets are your testing ground! Don't just walk; steal cars off the street and turn traffic upside down. Use your overwhelming power to turn innocent people into zombies, or smash objects and enemies to pieces with satisfying melee weapons. Enjoy hilarious, voxel-style combat where arms and heads fly through the air!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/d59b965ab9bf5f8999c8c10143fbded6.poster.avif?t=1772696013\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/d59b965ab9bf5f8999c8c10143fbded6.webm?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/d59b965ab9bf5f8999c8c10143fbded6.mp4?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚓 <strong>Crime, Punishment, and Mad Pursuits:</strong> Be careful, every action has a consequence! NPCs living their own lives in the city can spot you and call the cops. As your Wanted Level rises, engage in relentless car chases to evade patrol cars and officers on foot, fight back, or lose your tail and take refuge in your lab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/9d5bf93bd48ac7fda2a923e5f3dbff7b.poster.avif?t=1772696013\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/9d5bf93bd48ac7fda2a923e5f3dbff7b.webm?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/9d5bf93bd48ac7fda2a923e5f3dbff7b.mp4?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 <strong>Management &amp; Strategy:</strong> A good villain manages their resources well. Work with your loyal Robot Assistant, organize your inventory, manage storage space, and buy necessary supplies from the black market to prepare for your next big &quot;doomsday experiment&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready, Doctor? The Society expects great things from you!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BEING THE BAD GUY HAS NEVER BEEN THIS FUN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of being the hero, playing by the rules, and saving the world? Put on your lab coat in <strong>Mad Scientist Simulator: Society of World Destruction</strong> and climb the ranks from a lowly <i>Lab Rat</i> to the ultimate <i>Syndicate Leader</i> to become the most favored member of the &quot;Society of World Destruction&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you are not just a lunatic shooting around; you are an evil genius working meticulously in your lab. Your goal: Complete missions from the Society, invent new technologies, and unleash ultimate chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/ae6048ec22f9a5d13957852450261f8b.poster.avif?t=1772696013\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/ae6048ec22f9a5d13957852450261f8b.webm?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/ae6048ec22f9a5d13957852450261f8b.mp4?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 <strong>Your Lab &amp; Workshop, Your Fortress:</strong> Chaos hits the streets, but it's brewed in the lab. Create deadly viruses, acid mixtures, and DNA modifications through 2D and 3D mini-games at your chemistry and biology tables. Not enough? <strong>Head over to the Lathe Machine to assemble your own custom weapons piece by piece and boost your firepower!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/1bdb946f81dc7390b53e72bfe4f8826a.poster.avif?t=1772696013\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/1bdb946f81dc7390b53e72bfe4f8826a.webm?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/1bdb946f81dc7390b53e72bfe4f8826a.mp4?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ <strong>Global Domination (War Room):</strong> Spread your evil not just to the neighborhood, but to the entire world! Enter the War Room in your lab, select target countries on the interactive world map, and strategically deploy the drones and robots you've crafted to bring cities under the Society's control one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/f3a98ffa3cd13cd35a7b6a7a7d119609.poster.avif?t=1772696013\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/f3a98ffa3cd13cd35a7b6a7a7d119609.webm?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/f3a98ffa3cd13cd35a7b6a7a7d119609.mp4?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗 <strong>Wreak Havoc in the City:</strong> The streets are your testing ground! Don't just walk; steal cars off the street and turn traffic upside down. Use your overwhelming power to turn innocent people into zombies, or smash objects and enemies to pieces with satisfying melee weapons. Enjoy hilarious, voxel-style combat where arms and heads fly through the air!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/d59b965ab9bf5f8999c8c10143fbded6.poster.avif?t=1772696013\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/d59b965ab9bf5f8999c8c10143fbded6.webm?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/d59b965ab9bf5f8999c8c10143fbded6.mp4?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚓 <strong>Crime, Punishment, and Mad Pursuits:</strong> Be careful, every action has a consequence! NPCs living their own lives in the city can spot you and call the cops. As your Wanted Level rises, engage in relentless car chases to evade patrol cars and officers on foot, fight back, or lose your tail and take refuge in your lab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/9d5bf93bd48ac7fda2a923e5f3dbff7b.poster.avif?t=1772696013\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304890/extras/9d5bf93bd48ac7fda2a923e5f3dbff7b.webm?t=1772696013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.aka